[en.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_NARROW_GATE]
Investigate §YNarrow Gate§!

[en.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_NARROW_GATE_desc]
After checking the archives of Nan Du, we finally traced the last whereabouts of the missing foal’s breath flowers: the Narrow Gate located at the eastern border.

[zh.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_NARROW_GATE]
调查§Y狭关§!

[zh.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_NARROW_GATE_desc]
通过南都的档案记录，我们终于追查到了消失的稚马之息最后出现的地方：位于东部边境的狭关。
